            <ArticleTitle>Ultrasound guided ablation of pseudoaneurysm following coronary artery stent placement: a preliminary report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>215-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A femoral artery pseudoaneurysm in a 47 year old woman following coronary artery stent placement was treated with color-flow duplex ultrasound guided compression. This technique may be useful following stent placement because of the requirement for continued anticoagulation post-procedure.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
